<title>USA: America West, flight attendants to mediate.</title>
<headline>America West, flight attendants to mediate.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>America West Holdings Corp, parent company of America West Airlines, and the Association of Flight Attendants have jointly filed for mediation in negotiations regarding an employee contract.</p>
<p>The Association of Flight Attendants (AFA), which is an affiliated of the AFL-CIO, represents the America West's 2,000 flight attendants.</p>
<p>Contract talks between AFA and America West began in December 1994, three months after the flight attendants voted for AFA representation.</p>
